"hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:"
104201,Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said
104202,Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said
104301,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abdullah ibn Ayyash ibn Abi Rabia al-Makhzumi ordered one of his slaves to slaughter an animal. When he wanted to slaughter it
104302,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abdullah ibn Ayyash ibn Abi Rabia al-Makhzumi ordered one of his slaves to slaughter an animal. When he wanted to slaughter it
104401,Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a man from the Ansar of the tribe of Banu Haritha was herding a pregnant she-camel at Uhud. It was about to die
104402,Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a man from the Ansar of the tribe of Banu Haritha was herding a pregnant she-camel at Uhud. It was about to die
104501,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from a man of the Ansar from Muadh ibn Sad or Sad ibn Muadh that a slave-girl of Kab ibn Malik was herding some sheep at Sal (a mountain near Madina). One of the sheep was about to die
104502,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from a man of the Ansar from Muadh ibn Sad or Sad ibn Muadh that a slave-girl of Kab ibn Malik was herding some sheep at Sal (a mountain near Madina). One of the sheep was about to die
104601,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Abdullah ibn Abbas was asked about animals slaughtered by the Christian Arabs. He said, ""There is no harm in them,"" but he recited this ayat, ""Whoever takes them as friends is from them."" (Sura 5 ayat)"
104602,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Abdullah ibn Abbas was asked about animals slaughtered by the Christian Arabs. He said, ""There is no harm in them,"" but he recited this ayat, ""Whoever takes them as friends is from them."" (Sura 5 ayat)"
104701,Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abbas used to say
104702,Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abbas used to say
104801,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said, ""Abu Bakr as-Siddiq used to pray witr when he wished to go to bed, and Umar ibn al-Khattab used to pray witr at the end of the night. As for me, I pray witr when I go to bed"
104802,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said, ""Abu Bakr as-Siddiq used to pray witr when he wished to go to bed, and Umar ibn al-Khattab used to pray witr at the end of the night. As for me, I pray witr when I go to bed"
104901,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abu Murra
104902,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abu Murra
105001,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said
105002,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said
105101,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt al-Laythi that Said ibn al- Musayyab said, ""The slaughter of what is in the womb is included in the slaughter of the mother if it is perfectly formed and its hair has begun to grow"
105102,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt al-Laythi that Said ibn al- Musayyab said, ""The slaughter of what is in the womb is included in the slaughter of the mother if it is perfectly formed and its hair has begun to grow"
